sort of triumphed so i enjoyed the parties which followed today the idea higgs pioneered called

00:34:49.970 --> 00:34:56.400
the higgs field is crucial to our understanding of space the higgs field is everywhere it's

00:34:56.400 --> 00:34:59.760
something that even in the emptiest vacuum of space has an effect

