establishing that the emptiest of empty space has an impact on all of matter.

00:36:18.160 --> 00:36:24.000
But it turns out that space contains an ingredient far more elusive than anything Higgs ever imagined.

00:36:24.640 --> 00:36:29.980
An ingredient that may hold the key to the greatest of all mysteries, the very...

00:36:30.000 --> 00:36:31.490
fate of the cosmos.

00:36:33.020 --> 00:36:36.480
It's a mystery that began some 14 billion years ago

00:36:38.950 --> 00:36:41.040
in what we call the Big Bang.

00:36:42.370 --> 00:36:44.780
In a fraction of a second, the universe

00:36:44.780 --> 00:36:48.180
underwent a violent expansion, sending space

00:36:48.180 --> 00:36:49.260
hurtling outward.

